    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14766" root="رثم" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَثْمَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A weak,</i> or <i>scanty, rain;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَثَمَةٌ</span></b> :
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِثَامٌ</span> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence, perhaps,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَلْ عِنْدَكَ رَثْمَةٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ خَبَرٍ</span> (assumed tropical:)  <i>Hast thou somewhat of news,</i> or <i>tidings.</i>
(K, * TA. [In the CK, erroneously, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">من خُبْزٍ</span>.])

